# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Packaging build artifacts (PLAN_PACKAGING.md §2.1/§2.4) - regenerated by
# `npm run package:orchestrator` and `scripts/fetch-node-runtime.sh`, never committed (the Node
# runtime alone is 50-100MB per platform).
dist-orchestrator
dist-node

# build-1..3's per-seat working directories (PLAN.md "Seat invocation mechanism") - real, runtime-
# generated file edits from real Claude Code sessions, never source. Was never actually committed
# (checked: `git log --all -- .workdirs` is empty) but was untracked-and-unignored until now, a
# real gap - a stray `git add -A` could have swept a builder's real edits into a commit.
.workdirs

# Phase 3 Step 1 (run-recorder.js): recorded plan-N relay runs (report.json/run.log/meta.json
# copies), runtime-generated per-machine history, never source - same reasoning as .workdirs
# above.
runs

# Secrets - nothing in this repo's own code ever writes these into the working tree today (API
# keys live in Tauri's <app_config_dir>/api-keys.json, outside the repo; relay's .env belongs to
# the separate relay checkout) - checked via full git history/content audit before making this
# repo public, 2026-09-10. Listed anyway as a backstop against a future accidental `cp`/`git add -A`,
# not because one of these has ever existed here.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
api-keys.json
resolved-paths.json
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
